  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "三十年不回家，父亲到死都不知道他是谁。九十三岁，老母亲看完证件哭了。家人们，我问你一个扎心的问题，如果你的父亲去世了，而你连回去奔丧都做不到，你会恨自己一辈子吗？有一个人，他就这么干，不是不想回，是不能回。整整三十年，家里人都以为他死了，兄弟姐妹骂他不孝，可他连一句我都在干什么都不能说。直到三十年后，九十三岁的老母亲看到他的工作证，才知道这个不孝子是中国的核潜艇之父。黄旭华黄旭华出生，在广东一个书香门第，从小就是学霸，一路考上了上海交通大学，学的是造船专业。年轻时候的他长得一表人才，前途一片光明。一九五八年国家找到了，他说，我们要搞核潜艇，需要你加入全程保密。尚不告父母，下不告妻儿，黄旭华想都没想就答应了。他心里清楚，新中国刚成立，海上没有防护，人家的军舰说开到我们家门口就开过来了。没有核潜艇，我们就没有海上的话语权。临走之前，他回了一趟老家跟父母告别，只说自己要去北京工作，以后可能很少回来。母亲拉着他的手说，你放心去干事业，家里不用你操心，寄得长写信回来，他嘴上答应着，心里却满是愧疚。因为他知道这一去别说写信了，连自己是死是活，家里都未必能知道。这一走就是整整三十年，搞核潜艇有多难？那时候全世界只有美国、苏联几个国家有技术严密封锁，我们连一张像样的图纸都没有。外国人甚至嘲讽说中国人想搞核潜艇，再等一百年吧。黄旭华不服气，没有资料，他们就从国外的报纸杂志里抠信息，一点点拼凑。没有计算机就用算盘计算尺，没日没夜的算算，错一个数就要从头再来。最苦的是心里的苦，他不能跟家里联系，不能说自己在做什么。家里来信问他在哪做什么工作，他每次都只字不提，只说自己一切都好。就这么熬了。一年又一年，一九七零年，中国第一艘核潜艇下水。一九八一年，第一艘导弹核潜艇下水，中国成为了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。可这时候的黄旭华已经从一个意气风发的青年变成了两鬓斑白的老人。一九八八年，核潜艇要做极限深浅试验，这是最危险的一步。国外很多次深浅试验都出过事故，停毁人亡。所有人都劝他，黄总，你是总设计师，你就别下去了，太危险了。黄旭华摇了摇头，说，我下去，我是总师，我必须对艇上每一个人的生命负责。就这样，六十二岁的黄旭华跟着潜艇一起下潜到了极限深度。当潜艇成功上浮，所有人都欢呼的时候，黄旭华却只是平静的拿起笔记下了所有数据。一九七五年老家传来电报，父亲病重不行了，让他赶紧回去见最后一面。黄旭华攥着那封电报，在办公室里坐了一下午电报，被他捏的皱巴巴的，他看了又看，放下，拿起来又放下。最后他做了一个决定，不回，不是不想回，是核潜艇正在最要命的攻关阶段。他是总负责人，他一走，整个项目的进度就要往后拖，父亲可以等，可国家的大仗等不起。那天晚上他一个人躲在办公室里关上门，谁也不知道他在里面哭了多久，父亲走了，他没能送终家里的兄弟姐妹，拍着桌子骂。他读了那么多书，连爹娘都不要了。他一句话都不辩解，那一年，他五十五岁从那天起，他把自己活成了一座。孤倒所有委屈愧疚思念全部咽进肚子里，一个字都不能说。十三年后，一九八八年，他终于能回家了。九十三岁的老母亲站在门口，看着这个满头白发的男人愣了很久很久，才认出这是自己的儿子。黄旭华扑通一声跪下去喊了一声娘，满屋子的人全都哭了。老母亲没哭，她只是颤巍巍的伸出手摸了摸儿子的脸，说回来就好。娘知道你是干大事的。人家人们。什么叫忠孝不能两全？这就是啊黄旭华把自己的三十年藏进了深海，藏进了国家的机密里，他对得起父亲，对不起家人。可他对得起这个国家，对得起我们每一个中国人。有人说他是英雄，可他自己却说，我不是英雄。我只是一个普普通通的科研工作者，国家需要我，我就去做。就是这样一句朴实的话，藏着中国人最硬的骨气，能理解这位老母亲心情的在评论区大致敬两个字，让这份理解被更多人看到。把这条视频转到家族群，让全家人一起看看什么叫真正的顶天立地。顺手点个收藏，下次教育孩子的时候不用再翻半天，找不着关注我。每天一位国之脊梁，比追连续剧还上瘾。像他这样把一辈子藏进深海的英雄，书里还有四十位，每一篇都看的人热泪盈眶。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1370,
      "text": "三十年不回家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1610,
      "end_ms": 3830,
      "text": "父亲到死都不知道他是谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4390,
      "end_ms": 5270,
      "text": "九十三岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5290,
      "end_ms": 7130,
      "text": "老母亲看完证件哭了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00005",
      "start_ms": 7730,
      "end_ms": 8330,
      "text": "家人们，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00006",
      "start_ms": 8390,
      "end_ms": 10130,
      "text": "我问你一个扎心的问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00007",
      "start_ms": 10710,
      "end_ms": 12350,
      "text": "如果你的父亲去世了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00008",
      "start_ms": 12710,
      "end_ms": 14930,
      "text": "而你连回去奔丧都做不到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15230,
      "end_ms": 16910,
      "text": "你会恨自己一辈子吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00010",
      "start_ms": 17250,
      "end_ms": 17990,
      "text": "有一个人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00011",
      "start_ms": 18210,
      "end_ms": 19010,
      "text": "他就这么干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00012",
      "start_ms": 19890,
      "end_ms": 21050,
      "text": "不是不想回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21350,
      "end_ms": 22170,
      "text": "是不能回。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23110,
      "end_ms": 24330,
      "text": "整整三十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24550,
      "end_ms": 26190,
      "text": "家里人都以为他死了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00016",
      "start_ms": 26550,
      "end_ms": 28350,
      "text": "兄弟姐妹骂他不孝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00017",
      "start_ms": 28770,
      "end_ms": 31300,
      "text": "可他连一句我都在干什么都不能说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00018",
      "start_ms": 32200,
      "end_ms": 33460,
      "text": "直到三十年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00019",
      "start_ms": 33560,
      "end_ms": 36160,
      "text": "九十三岁的老母亲看到他的工作证，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00020",
      "start_ms": 36480,
      "end_ms": 40880,
      "text": "才知道这个不孝子是中国的核潜艇之父。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00021",
      "start_ms": 41140,
      "end_ms": 43640,
      "text": "黄旭华黄旭华出生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00022",
      "start_ms": 43640,
      "end_ms": 45360,
      "text": "在广东一个书香门第，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00023",
      "start_ms": 45860,
      "end_ms": 47220,
      "text": "从小就是学霸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00024",
      "start_ms": 47640,
      "end_ms": 49740,
      "text": "一路考上了上海交通大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00025",
      "start_ms": 50200,
      "end_ms": 51760,
      "text": "学的是造船专业。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00026",
      "start_ms": 52300,
      "end_ms": 55180,
      "text": "年轻时候的他长得一表人才，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00027",
      "start_ms": 55640,
      "end_ms": 57040,
      "text": "前途一片光明。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00028",
      "start_ms": 58680,
      "end_ms": 60940,
      "text": "一九五八年国家找到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00029",
      "start_ms": 60940,
      "end_ms": 61750,
      "text": "他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00030",
      "start_ms": 61750,
      "end_ms": 62975,
      "text": "我们要搞核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00031",
      "start_ms": 63430,
      "end_ms": 65925,
      "text": "需要你加入全程保密。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00032",
      "start_ms": 66310,
      "end_ms": 67345,
      "text": "尚不告父母，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00033",
      "start_ms": 67660,
      "end_ms": 68715,
      "text": "下不告妻儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00034",
      "start_ms": 68980,
      "end_ms": 70815,
      "text": "黄旭华想都没想就答应了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00035",
      "start_ms": 71220,
      "end_ms": 72155,
      "text": "他心里清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00036",
      "start_ms": 72620,
      "end_ms": 73955,
      "text": "新中国刚成立，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00037",
      "start_ms": 74290,
      "end_ms": 75715,
      "text": "海上没有防护，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00038",
      "start_ms": 76190,
      "end_ms": 79195,
      "text": "人家的军舰说开到我们家门口就开过来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00039",
      "start_ms": 79580,
      "end_ms": 80595,
      "text": "没有核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00040",
      "start_ms": 81340,
      "end_ms": 83415,
      "text": "我们就没有海上的话语权。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00041",
      "start_ms": 84200,
      "end_ms": 85000,
      "text": "临走之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00042",
      "start_ms": 85200,
      "end_ms": 87795,
      "text": "他回了一趟老家跟父母告别，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00043",
      "start_ms": 88230,
      "end_ms": 90055,
      "text": "只说自己要去北京工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00044",
      "start_ms": 90450,
      "end_ms": 92025,
      "text": "以后可能很少回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00045",
      "start_ms": 92940,
      "end_ms": 94605,
      "text": "母亲拉着他的手说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00046",
      "start_ms": 95090,
      "end_ms": 96475,
      "text": "你放心去干事业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00047",
      "start_ms": 97390,
      "end_ms": 98665,
      "text": "家里不用你操心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00048",
      "start_ms": 99110,
      "end_ms": 100515,
      "text": "寄得长写信回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00049",
      "start_ms": 101460,
      "end_ms": 102700,
      "text": "他嘴上答应着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00050",
      "start_ms": 102800,
      "end_ms": 104515,
      "text": "心里却满是愧疚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00051",
      "start_ms": 105200,
      "end_ms": 109205,
      "text": "因为他知道这一去别说写信了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00052",
      "start_ms": 109870,
      "end_ms": 111545,
      "text": "连自己是死是活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00053",
      "start_ms": 111900,
      "end_ms": 113295,
      "text": "家里都未必能知道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00054",
      "start_ms": 114180,
      "end_ms": 117295,
      "text": "这一走就是整整三十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00055",
      "start_ms": 118650,
      "end_ms": 120235,
      "text": "搞核潜艇有多难？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00056",
      "start_ms": 120740,
      "end_ms": 125965,
      "text": "那时候全世界只有美国、苏联几个国家有技术严密封锁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00057",
      "start_ms": 126350,
      "end_ms": 128935,
      "text": "我们连一张像样的图纸都没有。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00058",
      "start_ms": 129650,
      "end_ms": 133395,
      "text": "外国人甚至嘲讽说中国人想搞核潜艇，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00059",
      "start_ms": 133990,
      "end_ms": 135335,
      "text": "再等一百年吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00060",
      "start_ms": 136530,
      "end_ms": 137755,
      "text": "黄旭华不服气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00061",
      "start_ms": 138680,
      "end_ms": 139415,
      "text": "没有资料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00062",
      "start_ms": 139790,
      "end_ms": 142855,
      "text": "他们就从国外的报纸杂志里抠信息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00063",
      "start_ms": 143090,
      "end_ms": 144165,
      "text": "一点点拼凑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00064",
      "start_ms": 144610,
      "end_ms": 148075,
      "text": "没有计算机就用算盘计算尺，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00065",
      "start_ms": 148590,
      "end_ms": 150650,
      "text": "没日没夜的算算，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00066",
      "start_ms": 150670,
      "end_ms": 152645,
      "text": "错一个数就要从头再来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00067",
      "start_ms": 153570,
      "end_ms": 155795,
      "text": "最苦的是心里的苦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00068",
      "start_ms": 156330,
      "end_ms": 157695,
      "text": "他不能跟家里联系，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00069",
      "start_ms": 158000,
      "end_ms": 159755,
      "text": "不能说自己在做什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00070",
      "start_ms": 160060,
      "end_ms": 163025,
      "text": "家里来信问他在哪做什么工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00071",
      "start_ms": 163330,
      "end_ms": 165125,
      "text": "他每次都只字不提，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00072",
      "start_ms": 165520,
      "end_ms": 167175,
      "text": "只说自己一切都好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00073",
      "start_ms": 167570,
      "end_ms": 168290,
      "text": "就这么熬了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00074",
      "start_ms": 168290,
      "end_ms": 169175,
      "text": "一年又一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00075",
      "start_ms": 169890,
      "end_ms": 170835,
      "text": "一九七零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00076",
      "start_ms": 171300,
      "end_ms": 173425,
      "text": "中国第一艘核潜艇下水。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00077",
      "start_ms": 173930,
      "end_ms": 175035,
      "text": "一九八一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00078",
      "start_ms": 175470,
      "end_ms": 177835,
      "text": "第一艘导弹核潜艇下水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00079",
      "start_ms": 178190,
      "end_ms": 182595,
      "text": "中国成为了世界上第五个拥有核潜艇的国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00080",
      "start_ms": 183520,
      "end_ms": 191495,
      "text": "可这时候的黄旭华已经从一个意气风发的青年变成了两鬓斑白的老人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00081",
      "start_ms": 192140,
      "end_ms": 193065,
      "text": "一九八八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00082",
      "start_ms": 193350,
      "end_ms": 196285,
      "text": "核潜艇要做极限深浅试验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00083",
      "start_ms": 197050,
      "end_ms": 198475,
      "text": "这是最危险的一步。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00084",
      "start_ms": 199340,
      "end_ms": 202595,
      "text": "国外很多次深浅试验都出过事故，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00085",
      "start_ms": 203350,
      "end_ms": 204335,
      "text": "停毁人亡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00086",
      "start_ms": 205450,
      "end_ms": 206805,
      "text": "所有人都劝他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00087",
      "start_ms": 207190,
      "end_ms": 207685,
      "text": "黄总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00088",
      "start_ms": 210180,
      "end_ms": 211295,
      "text": "你是总设计师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00089",
      "start_ms": 211550,
      "end_ms": 212575,
      "text": "你就别下去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00090",
      "start_ms": 213560,
      "end_ms": 214335,
      "text": "太危险了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00091",
      "start_ms": 215730,
      "end_ms": 216945,
      "text": "黄旭华摇了摇头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00092",
      "start_ms": 217870,
      "end_ms": 218215,
      "text": "说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00093",
      "start_ms": 220240,
      "end_ms": 220935,
      "text": "我下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00094",
      "start_ms": 222350,
      "end_ms": 223090,
      "text": "我是总师，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00095",
      "start_ms": 223250,
      "end_ms": 226085,
      "text": "我必须对艇上每一个人的生命负责。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00096",
      "start_ms": 226650,
      "end_ms": 227145,
      "text": "就这样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00097",
      "start_ms": 227590,
      "end_ms": 232835,
      "text": "六十二岁的黄旭华跟着潜艇一起下潜到了极限深度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00098",
      "start_ms": 233600,
      "end_ms": 235385,
      "text": "当潜艇成功上浮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00099",
      "start_ms": 235820,
      "end_ms": 237535,
      "text": "所有人都欢呼的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00100",
      "start_ms": 237890,
      "end_ms": 241955,
      "text": "黄旭华却只是平静的拿起笔记下了所有数据。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00101",
      "start_ms": 242670,
      "end_ms": 245005,
      "text": "一九七五年老家传来电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00102",
      "start_ms": 245380,
      "end_ms": 247285,
      "text": "父亲病重不行了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00103",
      "start_ms": 247620,
      "end_ms": 249675,
      "text": "让他赶紧回去见最后一面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00104",
      "start_ms": 250380,
      "end_ms": 252145,
      "text": "黄旭华攥着那封电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00105",
      "start_ms": 252520,
      "end_ms": 255430,
      "text": "在办公室里坐了一下午电报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00106",
      "start_ms": 255430,
      "end_ms": 256930,
      "text": "被他捏的皱巴巴的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00107",
      "start_ms": 256950,
      "end_ms": 258135,
      "text": "他看了又看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00108",
      "start_ms": 258490,
      "end_ms": 259035,
      "text": "放下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00109",
      "start_ms": 259340,
      "end_ms": 260975,
      "text": "拿起来又放下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00110",
      "start_ms": 261450,
      "end_ms": 262625,
      "text": "最后他做了一个决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00111",
      "start_ms": 263300,
      "end_ms": 263775,
      "text": "不回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00112",
      "start_ms": 264670,
      "end_ms": 265585,
      "text": "不是不想回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00113",
      "start_ms": 266120,
      "end_ms": 269985,
      "text": "是核潜艇正在最要命的攻关阶段。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00114",
      "start_ms": 270910,
      "end_ms": 272215,
      "text": "他是总负责人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00115",
      "start_ms": 272850,
      "end_ms": 273425,
      "text": "他一走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00116",
      "start_ms": 273710,
      "end_ms": 275935,
      "text": "整个项目的进度就要往后拖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00117",
      "start_ms": 276420,
      "end_ms": 277335,
      "text": "父亲可以等，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00118",
      "start_ms": 277800,
      "end_ms": 279905,
      "text": "可国家的大仗等不起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00119",
      "start_ms": 280320,
      "end_ms": 284125,
      "text": "那天晚上他一个人躲在办公室里关上门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00120",
      "start_ms": 284500,
      "end_ms": 286405,
      "text": "谁也不知道他在里面哭了多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00121",
      "start_ms": 286960,
      "end_ms": 287815,
      "text": "父亲走了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00122",
      "start_ms": 288040,
      "end_ms": 290680,
      "text": "他没能送终家里的兄弟姐妹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00123",
      "start_ms": 290680,
      "end_ms": 291520,
      "text": "拍着桌子骂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00124",
      "start_ms": 291520,
      "end_ms": 292785,
      "text": "他读了那么多书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00125",
      "start_ms": 293170,
      "end_ms": 294745,
      "text": "连爹娘都不要了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00126",
      "start_ms": 295040,
      "end_ms": 296625,
      "text": "他一句话都不辩解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00127",
      "start_ms": 297260,
      "end_ms": 297875,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00128",
      "start_ms": 298170,
      "end_ms": 300465,
      "text": "他五十五岁从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00129",
      "start_ms": 300820,
      "end_ms": 302345,
      "text": "他把自己活成了一座。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00130",
      "start_ms": 302730,
      "end_ms": 308290,
      "text": "孤倒所有委屈愧疚思念全部咽进肚子里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00131",
      "start_ms": 308470,
      "end_ms": 309610,
      "text": "一个字都不能说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00132",
      "start_ms": 310570,
      "end_ms": 311390,
      "text": "十三年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00133",
      "start_ms": 311730,
      "end_ms": 312770,
      "text": "一九八八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00134",
      "start_ms": 312770,
      "end_ms": 314150,
      "text": "他终于能回家了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00135",
      "start_ms": 315350,
      "end_ms": 319170,
      "text": "九十三岁的老母亲站在门口，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00136",
      "start_ms": 319650,
      "end_ms": 323790,
      "text": "看着这个满头白发的男人愣了很久很久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00137",
      "start_ms": 324330,
      "end_ms": 326710,
      "text": "才认出这是自己的儿子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00138",
      "start_ms": 327810,
      "end_ms": 331070,
      "text": "黄旭华扑通一声跪下去喊了一声娘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00139",
      "start_ms": 331390,
      "end_ms": 333640,
      "text": "满屋子的人全都哭了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00140",
      "start_ms": 333760,
      "end_ms": 334700,
      "text": "老母亲没哭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00141",
      "start_ms": 335140,
      "end_ms": 338660,
      "text": "她只是颤巍巍的伸出手摸了摸儿子的脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00142",
      "start_ms": 338880,
      "end_ms": 340100,
      "text": "说回来就好。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00143",
      "start_ms": 340360,
      "end_ms": 342260,
      "text": "娘知道你是干大事的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00144",
      "start_ms": 342260,
      "end_ms": 343500,
      "text": "人家人们。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00145",
      "start_ms": 343720,
      "end_ms": 345780,
      "text": "什么叫忠孝不能两全？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00146",
      "start_ms": 346320,
      "end_ms": 350860,
      "text": "这就是啊黄旭华把自己的三十年藏进了深海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00147",
      "start_ms": 351580,
      "end_ms": 353440,
      "text": "藏进了国家的机密里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00148",
      "start_ms": 353720,
      "end_ms": 354980,
      "text": "他对得起父亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00149",
      "start_ms": 355280,
      "end_ms": 356300,
      "text": "对不起家人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00150",
      "start_ms": 356780,
      "end_ms": 358400,
      "text": "可他对得起这个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00151",
      "start_ms": 359180,
      "end_ms": 361875,
      "text": "对得起我们每一个中国人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00152",
      "start_ms": 363060,
      "end_ms": 364420,
      "text": "有人说他是英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00153",
      "start_ms": 364480,
      "end_ms": 365635,
      "text": "可他自己却说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00154",
      "start_ms": 366650,
      "end_ms": 367725,
      "text": "我不是英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00155",
      "start_ms": 368200,
      "end_ms": 371635,
      "text": "我只是一个普普通通的科研工作者，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00156",
      "start_ms": 372200,
      "end_ms": 373235,
      "text": "国家需要我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00157",
      "start_ms": 373540,
      "end_ms": 374275,
      "text": "我就去做。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00158",
      "start_ms": 374990,
      "end_ms": 376885,
      "text": "就是这样一句朴实的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00159",
      "start_ms": 377440,
      "end_ms": 379815,
      "text": "藏着中国人最硬的骨气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00160",
      "start_ms": 380400,
      "end_ms": 385765,
      "text": "能理解这位老母亲心情的在评论区大致敬两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00161",
      "start_ms": 386370,
      "end_ms": 388945,
      "text": "让这份理解被更多人看到。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00162",
      "start_ms": 389930,
      "end_ms": 392405,
      "text": "把这条视频转到家族群，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00163",
      "start_ms": 392950,
      "end_ms": 397130,
      "text": "让全家人一起看看什么叫真正的顶天立地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00164",
      "start_ms": 397410,
      "end_ms": 398750,
      "text": "顺手点个收藏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00165",
      "start_ms": 399090,
      "end_ms": 401670,
      "text": "下次教育孩子的时候不用再翻半天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00166",
      "start_ms": 401670,
      "end_ms": 404175,
      "text": "找不着关注我。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00167",
      "start_ms": 405540,
      "end_ms": 407345,
      "text": "每天一位国之脊梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00168",
      "start_ms": 408110,
      "end_ms": 410055,
      "text": "比追连续剧还上瘾。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00169",
      "start_ms": 411000,
      "end_ms": 414085,
      "text": "像他这样把一辈子藏进深海的英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00170",
      "start_ms": 415030,
      "end_ms": 416175,
      "text": "书里还有四十位，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_6db04c8b0034e816_s00171",
      "start_ms": 416600,
      "end_ms": 419315,
      "text": "每一篇都看的人热泪盈眶。"
    }
  ],
